The workspace brings observation coverage, fleet readiness, and
recent collaboration together.

3
00:00:12,790 --> 00:00:16,675
One DeepSeek orchestrator routes requests to specialist modules.
Vision is unconfigured, and transfer is

4
00:00:16,675 --> 00:00:20,560
experimental.

5
00:00:20,560 --> 00:00:25,815
A natural language request triggers the actual V3 model and
spatial analysis. BRUUNS is forecast at about nine

6
00:00:25,815 --> 00:00:31,070
hundred and three available spaces, with traceable evidence.

7
00:00:31,070 --> 00:00:34,930
Explore geographic relationships between six garages. Similarity
is a spatial prior, not prediction

